   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Expert inom IT till EU:s h&#xf6;gkvarter</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSB seconds a national staff to HQ for EU civilan missions to support increased capacity of IT arrangements at central level</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sekonderad personal till EU huvudkvarter f&#xf6;r civila missioner</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MSB&apos;s support was expected to contribute to the receiving organization being able to quickly coordinate the necessary resources for the missions, through a guaranteed HQ capacity to plan, prioritize, implement and develop the in-depth support to the receiving organization.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MSB:s st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas bidra till att mottagande organisation snabbt kan samordna n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga resurser till missionerna, genom en s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lld HQ kapacitet att planera, prioritera, genomf&#xf6;ra samt utveckla det insatsn&#xe4;ra st&#xf6;det till mottagande organisation.</narrative>
  </description>
